{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56848","headline":"南岳仙题金牛石壁 · 不详","name":"南岳仙题金牛石壁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"手持黄鹤来，脚踏金牛背。\n尘世无人知，白云久相待。\n（见《沅湘耆旧集》卷十三。\n（按：宋以後着作中托名唐代神仙诗，爲数甚夥，尤以吕岩诗爲最多，就余所见，数在千首以上，今皆不取。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56848.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56848","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}